ocal"}, {"identity": "local:github_read_file", "name": "github_read_file", "schema_sha256": "21a3737ea1c3b76dc98d2244099c2686b646787c96a6ad0c89de3ffc6a26b5cd", "source": "local"}, {"identity": "local:terminate", "name": "terminate", "schema_sha256": "775491ac95d86ec1aa76465d93789196472ad2fb804c16ed8ad84ddff55771f3", "source": "local"}], "index_version": {"content_fingerprint": "21cc6889c2dd4352c28d706583b78a32088e437d87a149deba9ba02a36d265f8", "model_id": "sentence-transformers/paraphrase-MiniLM-L3-v2", "model_revision": "4ca70771034acceecb2e72475f72050fcdde4ddc", "vector_version": "tool-metadata-json-v1/cosine-v1/mean-pool-128-v1"}, "k_business": 3, "k_total": 4, "metadata_version": "21cc6889c2dd4352c28d706583b78a32088e437d87a149deba9ba02a36d265f8", "query": {"chars": 730, "observation_tool_call_id": "call_01_fM1h3IHJZ9yvSXvfm7Ro3868", "sha256": "00b29913d524efcc842ea11e34f7a3df38d5c76ffd79f73f52a6470471e3b7b8", "summary": "task_and_observation"}, "run_id": "b08abcbf91924a5da51d0f6f5e7b278b", "selected_tools": [{"name": "terminate", "tool_call_id": "call_00_UkcISCPdTg49ZMzhrscD2538"}], "selection_status": "selected", "step": 7, "version": 1}], "finished": false, "max_steps_reached": false, "final_answer_excerpt": "The trace is complete. To summarize the conclusion:\n\n**Issue #1427** (https://github.com/FoundationAgents/OpenManus/issues/1427) — \"MCP 工具结果忽略 isError，失败被当作普通输出\" — traces directly to **`MCPClientTool.execute()` in `app/tool/mcp.py`** (https://github.com/FoundationAgents/OpenManus/blob/main/app/tool/mcp.py).\n\n- The `result = await self.session.call_tool(...)` return value is unpacked only for `TextContent`/`ImageContent`; `result.isError` is never consulted, so `ToolResult(error=...)` is never set.\n- Empty-content failures collapse to the literal `\"No output returned.\"`, exactly as the issue describes.\n- A repo-wide search for `isError` returns 0 matches, and `ToolResult` in `app/tool/base.py` already supports a distinct `error` field plus error-aware `__str__`, so the intended fix is to map `isError` → `ToolResult.error` (with a fallback message) while preserving `base64_image`.", "final_answer_truncated": false, "elapsed_ms": 18452.7, "error": null, "completed_at_utc": "2026-10-08T06:16:52.013000+00:00"}
